;; Campaign play only (0.4.29): the demon temple, Jaquio's lair (`ng-temple`, in the castle
;; family): crimson stone, carved blocks with gold eyes and a lacquered bridge on a gold chain over
;; the lava, a carved wall and demon-headed pillars painted behind. It plays the Masked Ninja's
;; tune. Castle play is unchanged (the fake Bowser's unmask, the castle remark). Elsewhere (level
;; select, ?level=6-4) it looks as it always did.
